<urn:atm:triage:finding/AI26-ATMQA-002>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AI26-ATMQA-002" ;
  triage:title "Required deterministic delayed-peer/cancellation/retry/tracked-work tests from sprint-ai-26 were not added" ;
  triage:description "Quality-mgr independently reviewed feature/pAI-s26-peer-write-deadline @ dc079fff8a96a5441e1eda3c790383670589f2f9 (AICH-S6, sprint-ai-26 peer-write-deadline). docs/plans/phase-ai/sprint-ai-26-peer-write-deadline.md's Required validation section calls for: Deterministic delayed-peer tests for budget propagation, disconnect, cancellation, and retry with the original ULID; runtime tracked-work test. The actual diff only: (1) adjusted 2 pre-existing tests' expected error code (DaemonUnavailable -> RemoteDeliveryUnconfirmed) in tests/runtime_root.rs:324 and tests/runtime_root/peer_reconciliation.rs:80, and (2) added 2 small unit tests in https_transport.rs (request_deadline_is_one_absolute_budget, expired_peer_budget_reports_remote_delivery_unconfirmed) that test the RequestDeadline/remaining_budget helpers directly, not an end-to-end delayed-peer scenario. No new deterministic test simulates a delayed peer response to prove budget propagation end-to-end, no disconnect-mid-flight test, no cancellation-race test, no retry-with-original-ULID test, and no new runtime tracked-work test was added. This gap is the same class of gap that let the AI26-ATMQA-001 handshake-mapping bug through untested." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-AI" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "ATM-QA" ;
  triage:severity "Important" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "file" ;
  triage:status "open" ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-07-25T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI26-ATMQA-002/pAI-s26/1> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/AI26-ATMQA-002/pAI-s27/1> ;
  triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAI-s26/dc079fff> ;
  triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAI-s27/dc079fff> ;
  triage:promoteTo <urn:atm:triage:worktree/pAI-s27/dc079fff> .

